>I'm having trouble with the X windows version of nethack on my system.
>Has anyone had a problem with the focus of the popup widgets?  I find
>that as soon as a message such as inventory or .. whatever I no longer
>have input to the game.  I can access the winmap ('nethack' widget) and
>this is receiving keyboard and mouse button presses but the window that
>I assume wants the messages doesn't.  
>
>I'm using X11R4 on a sun3/50.

I use a SPARCStation2, X11R5, and have had no problems. However, input focus is
a question of what window manager you have and how you have it setup. Under
OpenWindows the default is to have the focus follow wherever you point, but you
can set this to be so that focus sticks to whatever window you clicked on last.

Try to click on whetever window you want to input to, and make sure you keep
pointing into that window when you type.

